Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.36,0:21:06.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like Goldman, Silverman?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.36,0:21:06.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}像是高德曼  西尔弗曼  
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.92,0:21:09.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because it's not his last name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.92,0:21:09.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为那不是他的姓
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.53,0:21:12.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- It isn't? - No, it's not, like...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.53,0:21:12.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不是吗  -他又不叫
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.57,0:21:15.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Phil Spiderman.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.57,0:21:15.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲尔·斯派德曼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.64,0:21:19.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's a Spider-man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.64,0:21:19.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是个蜘蛛...侠
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.65,0:21:23.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, like
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.65,0:21:23.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比如说
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.23,0:21:27.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Goldman is a last name. But there's no Gold Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.23,0:21:27.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}像高德曼是姓氏  但是没有金人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.34,0:21:30.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.34,0:21:30.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.04,0:21:32.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There should be a Gold Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.04,0:21:32.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}应该有金人的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.77,0:21:35.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.77,0:21:35.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.89,0:21:37.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- How was work? - Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.89,0:21:37.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-工作顺利吗  -不错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.47,0:21:40.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Although I did sit down where there wasn't a chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.47,0:21:40.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是我坐下的时候不小心摔到地上了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.39,0:21:43.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}By the way, Ross dropped by a box of your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.39,0:21:43.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了  罗斯拿了一盒你的东西来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.89,0:21:47.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Well, I guess I had that one coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.89,0:21:47.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}意料之中的事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.68,0:21:50.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm just gonna throw it out. It's probably just shampoo and...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.68,0:21:50.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}直接扔掉吧  还不是洗发水还有...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.03,0:21:54.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.03,0:21:54.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.68,0:22:05.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.68,0:22:05.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没  没事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.23,0:22:16.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So what kind of powers would "Gold Man" have?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.23,0:22:16.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么  "金人"有什么超能力
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.09,0:22:20.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Well, he would turn things to gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.09,0:22:20.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他能把东西变成金子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.70,0:22:25.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What about things that are already gold? - His work is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.70,0:22:25.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-已经是金子的东西呢  -那他就不用变了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.69,0:22:28.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Okay. Let's play my game now. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.69,0:22:28.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-来玩我的游戏吧  -好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.34,0:22:33.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, you yellow-bellied, lily-livered...
